  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Luca Steffen is a Swiss millionaire entrepreneur and co-founder of Emix Trading, the Zug-based company that supplied protective masks during the coronavirus pandemic. He established the business with Jascha Rudolphi and lawyer Peter Ackermann. Its profits brought him wealth in his twenties, and he later became chairman of its board.",
    "html": "<p>Luca Steffen is a Swiss millionaire entrepreneur and co-founder of Emix Trading, the Zug-based company that supplied protective masks during the coronavirus pandemic. He established the business with Jascha Rudolphi and lawyer Peter Ackermann. Its profits brought him wealth in his twenties, and he later became chairman of its board.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
