  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "While completing his school-leaving qualification, Luca Steffen helped build an import business that delivered branded drinks to Swiss takeaway restaurants. He and his partner drove the deliveries themselves, initially earning modest monthly sums. Their work extended to sourcing products outside manufacturers’ usual distribution channels for wholesalers and retailers.\n\nReliable supply was harder to secure than an attractive price. Steffen maintained contacts in several countries so that another supplier could fill a gap when stock became unavailable. He also dealt with labelling rules and customs paperwork: without certificates of origin, some goods attracted additional duties despite free-trade agreements.",
    "html": "<p>While completing his school-leaving qualification, Luca Steffen helped build an import business that delivered branded drinks to Swiss takeaway restaurants. He and his partner drove the deliveries themselves, initially earning modest monthly sums. Their work extended to sourcing products outside manufacturers’ usual distribution channels for wholesalers and retailers.</p>\r\n<p>Reliable supply was harder to secure than an attractive price. Steffen maintained contacts in several countries so that another supplier could fill a gap when stock became unavailable. He also dealt with labelling rules and customs paperwork: without certificates of origin, some goods attracted additional duties despite free-trade agreements.</p>\r\n",
